    "compose_patient": {
      "sections": [
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.0",
          "heading": "why_in_hospital",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.0",
            "sections.1"
          ],
          "text": "You came in with shortness of breath, green sputum and wheeze that had been getting worse over 4 days.\n\nThe team found you were having a flare-up of your COPD (chronic obstructive pulmonary disease). Your breathing was not working well enough, and carbon dioxide was building up in your blood. This is called type 2 respiratory failure."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.1",
          "heading": "what_we_did",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.2",
            "sections.3"
          ],
          "text": "When you arrived, your oxygen levels were low and your blood was more acidic than normal.\n\nThe team gave you:\n- Controlled oxygen\n- NIV (a mask that helps you breathe)\n- Nebulisers (breathing treatments through a mask)\n- A steroid (hydrocortisone) through a drip, then steroid tablets (prednisolone)\n- An antibiotic (amoxicillin) through a drip, then antibiotic tablets\n\nOn 18/05 you were able to come off the breathing mask. Your oxygen levels settled back to your usual level on your home oxygen.\n\nThe team also checked and reviewed your inhaler technique."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.2",
          "heading": "medicines",
          "source_ids": [],
          "text": "{{MEDICATIONS}}"
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.3",
          "heading": "next_steps",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.7",
            "sections.8"
          ],
          "text": "- You have a respiratory clinic appointment in 6 weeks.\n- A referral has been made to the community respiratory team.\n- Your GP will review you after this flare-up."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.4",
          "heading": "safety_net",
          "source_ids": [],
          "text": "{{SAFETY_NET}}"
        }
